title: Fundraising
new-page: true
view-if: fundraising_timer <= 0 and (not historical_mode)
on-arrival: fundraising_timer = 6; month_actions += 1
frequency: 300
is-card: true
card-image: img/WheresMoneyComingFrom.jpg
tags: party_affairs

= Fundraising

For better or for worse, the party cannot exist without money.

Current Dues: [+ dues +]

- @maintain: Maintain our current dues.
- @reduce: Reduce dues.
- @increase: Increase dues.

@maintain
subtitle: No change to dues.
on-arrival: dues += 1;

We maintain our current dues.

@reduce
subtitle: -1 to dues.
choose-if: dues > 1
on-arrival: dues -= 1; left_hardliner_dissent -= 8; agrarian_dissent -= 8; managerial_dissent -= 8; labour_dissent -= 8

Our current members appreciate this, but no one decides to join a party because of the low dues.

@increase
subtitle: +1 to dues. [? if dues >= 4 : Dues are already rather high; increasing them might reduce our membership. ?]
on-arrival: dues += 1; workers_ccf -= 3; unemployed_ccf -= 3; workers_ccf -= 10 if unemployed >= 15; unemployed_ccf -= 10 if unemployed >= 15; workers_ccf -= 3*dues if dues >= 5; unemployed_ccf -= 3*dues if dues >= 5
view-if: dues <= 4

Our members grumble at this, and some of the less committed members leave. But now, we have access to additional resources. 

[? if unemployed >= 15 : Because of the presently high unemployment, our members are feeling the extra burden hard. ?]

